new music.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-04-30T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"TF9PqINtiMY","position":15,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Gregory Isaacs - Rock On","track":{"id":"pWDlHXoUIo4","path":"/artists/gregory-isaacs/tracks/rock-on/","slug":"rock-on","title":"Rock On","artist":{"slug":"gregory-isaacs","title":"Gregory Isaacs"},"artwork":"images/artists/gregory-isaacs/tracks/rock-on.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"IgJtl2M_Vk0","slug":"140","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-140-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #140 w/ Esta & Andres","artwork":"/images/episodes/140.jpg","content":"\nESTA and Andres stop on by and deliver solid sets.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nHad to start this show with a new unreleased gem from Kaytra and play all the classics/unreleased material as usual. Esta finally stopped by to drop an official set and talk about what's next for him. He really impressed us with his house vibes. This man is diverse. Andres also came through and graced us with a heavy hitter set. Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10805,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"ucgYVwPvBJ8","position":6,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Gregory Isaacs - Rock On","track":{"id":"pWDlHXoUIo4","path":"/artists/gregory-isaacs/tracks/rock-on/","slug":"rock-on","title":"Rock On","artist":{"slug":"gregory-isaacs","title":"Gregory Isaacs"},"artwork":"images/artists/gregory-isaacs/tracks/rock-on.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"BDetsr-_b9I","slug":"154","tags":[1,15],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #154","artwork":"/images/episodes/154.jpg","content":"Joe Kay really displayed a crazy selection of music that will have you copying/pasting consistently within Google for some time. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are a lot of new tunes sprinkled with the 'feel-good' classics that we always connect to our sets. It's essential for us to keep educating you with the influences and how it all connects to where we are today. Spread this set to as many people as possible! More minds and ears need to hear this music!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10901,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-30T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"S_D9hiUe6_o","position":74,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Gregory Isaacs - Rock On","track":{"id":"pWDlHXoUIo4","path":"/artists/gregory-isaacs/tracks/rock-on/","slug":"rock-on","title":"Rock On","artist":{"slug":"gregory-isaacs","title":"Gregory Isaacs"},"artwork":"images/artists/gregory-isaacs/tracks/rock-on.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"my3sd-7c2Ss","slug":"198","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-198"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #198","artwork":"/images/episodes/198.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10851,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-12-20T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"nNdUhRK6Urg","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Gregory Isaacs - Rock On","track":{"id":"pWDlHXoUIo4","path":"/artists/gregory-isaacs/tracks/rock-on/","slug":"rock-on","title":"Rock On","artist":{"slug":"gregory-isaacs","title":"Gregory Isaacs"},"artwork":"images/artists/gregory-isaacs/tracks/rock-on.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"J5J-zh8k3bw","slug":"213","tags":[7,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-213-w-kr"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #213 w/ KR","artwork":"/images/episodes/213.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n","profile"